6135600000#c5989900332570788209' title=''/><author><name>Connor</name><uri>http://www.connorboyack.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8545906808060732344' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8545906808060732344' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 9, 2007 at 10:20 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6490992383699547500</id><published>2007-04-08T22:54:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-08T22:54:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wayne... one of mine, if not THE favorite verse.  ...</title><content type='html'>Wayne... one of mine, if not THE favorite verse.  For the JOY set before him...  There in a nutshell is the reason why He endured it all.  He saw beyond the suffering and pain, beyond the temporal and into the ageless expanse of eternity, where an innumerable host, saved through His sacrifice, are gathered together.  Oh the Joy!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/6490992383699547500'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/6490992383699547500'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html?showComment=1176094440000#c6490992383699547500' title=''/><author><name>DrFix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15912619928812368990</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8545906808060732344' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8545906808060732344' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-872085076"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 8, 2007 at 10:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3094459947281227641</id><published>2007-04-08T22:04:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-08T22:04:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>He is Risen Indeed!</title><content type='html'>He is Risen Indeed!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/3094459947281227641'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/3094459947281227641'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html?showComment=1176091440000#c3094459947281227641' title=''/><author><name>Captain Kirk</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05111692386028869573</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='23' height='32' src='http://photos1.blogger.com/blogger/4723/3681/1600/St.%20Kirk.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8545906808060732344' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8545906808060732344' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1877233996"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 8, 2007 at 10:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4972565095864281776</id><published>2007-04-08T21:03:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-08T21:03:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Heb 12:2  looking to Jesus, the founder and perfec...</title><content type='html'>Heb 12:2  looking to Jesus, the founder and perfecter of our faith, who for the joy that was set before him endured the cross, despising the shame, and is seated at the right hand of the throne of God. &lt;BR/&gt;Thank you Immanuel, for what we can not do, pay the price for our sins.&lt;BR/&gt;Amen</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/4972565095864281776'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/4972565095864281776'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html?showComment=1176087780000#c4972565095864281776' title=''/><author><name>Wayne in PA</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07798187933045157968</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8545906808060732344' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8545906808060732344' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-26911455"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 8, 2007 at 9:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8897278747811513447</id><published>2007-04-08T19:29:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-08T19:29:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Amen, Brother Grigg. I&#39;m very thrilled that you ha...</title><content type='html'>Amen, Brother Grigg. I&#39;m very thrilled that you have found the Lord Jesus Christ, or I should say &lt;I&gt;He&lt;/I&gt; found you (and me, and the rest of the saints). All of us, who are His children, can rest in the knowledge that He paid the penalty for our sins - past, present, and future - by His death on the Cross and that He is risen!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In fact, the core of Christianity and absolute assurance we have in Him is the reality of His resurrection, without which the central core message of Christianity would be vain and hopeless.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/8897278747811513447'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8545906808060732344/comments/default/8897278747811513447'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html?showComment=1176082140000#c8897278747811513447' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://members.cox.net/ogdenwb/images/dixiedog1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/resurrection-sunday-memo-to-loser.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8545906808060732344' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8545906808060732344' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 8, 2007 at 7:29 PM"/></entry></feed>